  "details": "Having an option to access the variables where the avatar is compare to a reference in the world through x y z coordinate and not only having the velocity. It would allow creators to anchor objects to specific positions. This could be helpful for props or static items that would otherwise move to a new location when the avatar is loaded in by a late joiner.\n\nThis would be helpful for example a sale stand or a chair or intractable items.",
